<!--
  Hardened-runtime entitlements of Arenile.app (Developer ID, not App Store,
  not sandboxed: the launcher writes to ~/Library/Application Support/Arenile
  and to a user-chosen backup folder, and listens on 127.0.0.1 / the LAN).

  A Go binary needs no JIT, unsigned-memory or library-validation exceptions,
  so the set is intentionally empty: every exception weakens notarization.
  Add one only with a written reason (e.g. a webview that loads a non-Apple
  framework would need com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation).
-->
